1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
PromptFinch
Select. Refine. Paste.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000
A manual workspace for
clearer English prompts.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Start with your goal, tone,
and constraints.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Include the answer language
and exact strings to preserve.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Choose a task and an optional
target-model hint.

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
The hint does not switch
the backend generation model.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Actual model result
deepseek-flash

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Check the answer language
and exact strings, such as ACME-42.

9
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Check the audience, tone,
limits, and exclusions.

10
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Copy includes only the prompt,
not the improvement notes.

11
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Review improvement notes
separately.

12
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Copy the prompt and check
the success message.

13
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Paste into a test document.

14
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,000
This edits instructions;
it does not perform the task.

15
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Four native interface languages:
Traditional Chinese, English, Japanese, Korean.

16
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Interface language and answer language
are separate.

17
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Live: your model API.
Mock: workflow only.

18
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Source on GitHub:
github.com/JERMYSUEN/promptfinch
